{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Survive the darkness. Expand your camp. Discover a cure. Find your brother.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Death Awaits</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mine is punishing, with dangers lurking around every corner. Some can be overcome, others must be avoided. What was once a safe path can turn deadly or be sealed off completely after a sudden earthquake.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925850/extras/0b057a4161a32dfcae238f704eb524ee.poster.avif?t=1757487092\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925850/extras/0b057a4161a32dfcae238f704eb524ee.webm?t=1757487092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925850/extras/0b057a4161a32dfcae238f704eb524ee.mp4?t=1757487092\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Safe Haven</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Establish camps around abandoned fire barrels for short-lived relief, but the fire must be kept alive. Sleep, recover, craft, store supplies and expand to improve your odds of survival and discovering a cure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925850/extras/bf81c70ea939a73d2699f80ef5bcac2c.poster.avif?t=1757487092\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925850/extras/bf81c70ea939a73d2699f80ef5bcac2c.webm?t=1757487092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925850/extras/bf81c70ea939a73d2699f80ef5bcac2c.mp4?t=1757487092\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the Depths</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descend into procedurally generated levels with handcrafted rooms and passageways. The deeper you go, the more hostile the environment becomes. Each biome introduces new dangers, challenges, mysteries and rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925850/extras/283ce3ff3ad00f631439bb3b4c8f90d1.poster.avif?t=1757487092\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925850/extras/283ce3ff3ad00f631439bb3b4c8f90d1.webm?t=1757487092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925850/extras/283ce3ff3ad00f631439bb3b4c8f90d1.mp4?t=1757487092\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Pack Smart</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Begin with a small backpack, just enough for the essentials. Choose carefully when packing items to save space, as packed items are locked away until you return to camp. Find and attach expansions to grow your backpack capacity or unlock specialized compartments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925850/extras/d53e5c37c6361ed17d80f74b345cbfed.poster.avif?t=1757487092\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925850/extras/d53e5c37c6361ed17d80f74b345cbfed.webm?t=1757487092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925850/extras/d53e5c37c6361ed17d80f74b345cbfed.mp4?t=1757487092\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage thirst, hunger, fatigue and strength. The storm lantern is required for light, but it is old and heavy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore procedurally generated levels with handcrafted rooms and passageways.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face death around every corner. Overcome dangers or avoid them as the mine grows more hostile the deeper you descend.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Begin with minimal backpack space. Expand with upgrades and manage items through a unique pack/unpack system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Establish camps to sleep, recover, craft, store supplies and expand with new equipment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harvest strange flora. Press, extract and identify. Splice bulbs to grow new species in your search for a cure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mine feeds on darkness. As corruption consumes you, your senses begin to betray you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn by doing. Pack, craft, pick locks and cook to level up skills and unlock upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the fate of your brother while piecing together the mine\u2019s secrets through logs, journals and notes.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3925850?t=1757487092","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3925850?t=1757487092","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925850/b44a2f2288182ca566b3171dbf2ec8e6c4a426b4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757487092","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925850/b44a2f2288182ca566b3171dbf2ec8e6c4a426b4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757487092","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Contains stylized depictions of blood, injury, and death via environmental hazards. Some scenes may be intense or unsettling."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Survive the darkness. Expand your camp. Discover a cure. Find your brother.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Death Awaits</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mine is punishing, with dangers lurking around every corner. Some can be overcome, others must be avoided. What was once a safe path can turn deadly or be sealed off completely after a sudden earthquake.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925850/extras/0b057a4161a32dfcae238f704eb524ee.poster.avif?t=1757487092\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925850/extras/0b057a4161a32dfcae238f704eb524ee.webm?t=1757487092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925850/extras/0b057a4161a32dfcae238f704eb524ee.mp4?t=1757487092\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Safe Haven</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Establish camps around abandoned fire barrels for short-lived relief, but the fire must be kept alive. Sleep, recover, craft, store supplies and expand to improve your odds of survival and discovering a cure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925850/extras/bf81c70ea939a73d2699f80ef5bcac2c.poster.avif?t=1757487092\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925850/extras/bf81c70ea939a73d2699f80ef5bcac2c.webm?t=1757487092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925850/extras/bf81c70ea939a73d2699f80ef5bcac2c.mp4?t=1757487092\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the Depths</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descend into procedurally generated levels with handcrafted rooms and passageways. The deeper you go, the more hostile the environment becomes. Each biome introduces new dangers, challenges, mysteries and rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925850/extras/283ce3ff3ad00f631439bb3b4c8f90d1.poster.avif?t=1757487092\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925850/extras/283ce3ff3ad00f631439bb3b4c8f90d1.webm?t=1757487092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925850/extras/283ce3ff3ad00f631439bb3b4c8f90d1.mp4?t=1757487092\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Pack Smart</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Begin with a small backpack, just enough for the essentials. Choose carefully when packing items to save space, as packed items are locked away until you return to camp. Find and attach expansions to grow your backpack capacity or unlock specialized compartments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925850/extras/d53e5c37c6361ed17d80f74b345cbfed.poster.avif?t=1757487092\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925850/extras/d53e5c37c6361ed17d80f74b345cbfed.webm?t=1757487092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925850/extras/d53e5c37c6361ed17d80f74b345cbfed.mp4?t=1757487092\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage thirst, hunger, fatigue and strength. The storm lantern is required for light, but it is old and heavy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore procedurally generated levels with handcrafted rooms and passageways.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face death around every corner. Overcome dangers or avoid them as the mine grows more hostile the deeper you descend.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Begin with minimal backpack space. Expand with upgrades and manage items through a unique pack/unpack system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Establish camps to sleep, recover, craft, store supplies and expand with new equipment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harvest strange flora. Press, extract and identify. Splice bulbs to grow new species in your search for a cure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mine feeds on darkness. As corruption consumes you, your senses begin to betray you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn by doing. Pack, craft, pick locks and cook to level up skills and unlock upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the fate of your brother while piecing together the mine\u2019s secrets through logs, journals and notes.</p></li></ul>","developers":["It's My First Day Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925850/98b54dc54cfd440086929b3551d8199f28966839/header.jpg?t=1757487092","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3925850/1108655018/64220863b9eaf7b4c8ad87ede7a31600c610e4c7/1755225017/dash_av1.mpd?t=1755232780","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3925850/1108655018/64220863b9eaf7b4c8ad87ede7a31600c610e4c7